+   "cell_type": "markdown",
+   "id": "abd55fb9",
+   "metadata": {},
+   "source": [
+    "Indeed, only synapses coming from the first neuron were modified (as its presynaptic compartment contained sodium), in contrast to synapses from neuron 2 (whose presynaptic compartment did not)."
+   ]
