+  {
+   "cell_type": "markdown",
+   "id": "9ee20537",
+   "metadata": {},
+   "source": [
+    "Now, all we have to do is to make these synaptic parameters trainable with the `make_trainable()` method:"
+   ]
+  },
+  {
+   "cell_type": "code",
+   "execution_count": 13,
+   "id": "75aad6bd",
+   "metadata": {},
+   "outputs": [
+    {
+     "name": "stdout",
+     "output_type": "stream",
